<h1>Unlock</h1>
<hr align="left" width="100.526%" size="5" class="whs3">
<p><span lang="EN-GB">This command is accessible from the</span> <i style="font-style:normal;"><span class="Path" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>tree context menu &gt; Unlock</b></span></i><span lang="EN-GB">.</span></p>
<p class="description"><span class="Command" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Description:</b></span> <span class="Command">Unlock</span> <span class="Command">command unlocks single or multiple entities or groups so that they will be affected when updating the current CS. It is available for all entities with the exception of transformations and view positions.</span></p>
<p>When entities are unlocked the small push-pins will disappear on their icons.</p>
<p>Unlocking can be performed even when there is already an active transformation. In this case there are two options:</p>
<p><img src="Images/Unlock_buttons.gif" width="423px" height="100px" border="0" class="img_whs4" alt=""></p>
<p class="parameterstitle">Unlock where it is</p>
<p class="parameterdescription"><span style="font-weight:normal;">The entities are unlocked at their current position and any other changes (back to World CS or updating with another transformation) will affect them.</span></p>
<p class="parameterstitle">Unlock and go to CCS</p>
<p class="parameterdescription"><span style="font-weight:normal;">he entities are unlocked and applied to the Current CS.</span></p>
<p class="parameterstitle">Cancel</p>
<p class="parameterdescription"><span style="font-weight:normal;">Cancels this dialog and leaves the entities at their current state.</span></p>
<p><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Use</b></span> <span lang="EN-GB" class="Command">Unlock</span> <span lang="EN-GB">to set objects that will be registered to a reference.</span></p>
<p><span lang="EN-GB"><a href="javascript:void(0);" onclick="var e; if (parseInt(navigator.appVersion)&gt;=4){e=event;} if (parseInt(navigator.appVersion) &gt;=2 &amp;&amp; typeof(PopupMenu_Invoke) == 'function') PopupMenu_Invoke(e,'','Lock in Space','Lock_in_Space.htm','Update Current CS','Update_Current_CS.htm');return false;" title=""><img src="../add_on/ss_btn_see_also.gif" border="0" height="17" width="60" alt=""></a></span></p>
